Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.55,Title,,0,0,0,,Doraemon's Health Check-Up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.51,0:00:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is he in such a hurry?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.04,0:00:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But he's always in hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.76,0:00:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon, I'm in deep trouble. \NWhat should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.53,0:00:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.86,0:00:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Giant bully you again?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.20,0:00:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.36,0:00:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.57,0:00:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Test, I will test tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.24,0:00:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Test, it is exaggerated.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.77,0:00:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It is fine that you study now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.81,0:00:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It is too late now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.98,0:01:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot what I studied.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.05,0:01:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I will test tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.61,0:01:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It is useless that you just studied one\Nday.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.92,0:01:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to get zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.79,0:01:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Dore...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.99,0:01:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Gees, I have been laughed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.90,0:01:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You look,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.43,0:01:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,to take light pen out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.87,0:01:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,To take light pen out, I could get full\Nmark.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.87,0:01:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.01,0:01:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You should depend on yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.94,0:01:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I have studied hard already.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.84,0:01:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,My study time is up every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.75,0:01:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I have tried my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.72,0:01:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It isn't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.72,0:01:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You should keep on studying hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.49,0:01:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But I will test tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.89,0:01:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It is late now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.76,0:01:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So please,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.72,0:01:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,give me light pen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.59,0:01:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.76,0:01:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.96,0:01:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I asked you to sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.27,0:02:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you don't give me light pen,\NI don't sit well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.27,0:02:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.41,0:02:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want... I don't do it if you don't\Ngive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.71,0:02:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.71,0:02:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.28,0:02:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You are brutal, you lie there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.02,0:02:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.45,0:02:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You ever gave me before.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.32,0:02:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I will study by myself next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.82,0:02:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.23,0:02:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.57,0:02:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.01,0:02:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.78,0:02:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What's matter with you, Doraemon?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.88,0:02:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You cheer up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.41,0:02:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What's matter with you, Doraemon?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.08,0:02:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I just a bit swirl.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.79,0:02:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Doraemon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.09,0:02:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't jump on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.83,0:02:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You look,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.13,0:02:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,it is Dorami.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.50,0:03:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Gees.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.43,0:03:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, it isn't your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.67,0:03:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Dorami, you came.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.64,0:03:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What? I again?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.07,0:03:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I am also busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.81,0:03:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you don't go to factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.28,0:03:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Factory?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.28,0:03:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We robot should go back factory\Nand check health yearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.88,0:03:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But brother don't go always.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.79,0:03:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I am fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.59,0:03:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you faint?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.73,0:03:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.16,0:03:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.26,0:03:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.67,0:03:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit, some strange sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.17,0:03:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You will die if you don't check again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.84,0:03:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit, I am fine, you are wordy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.11,0:03:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't care me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.01,0:03:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.78,0:03:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother is stubborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.15,0:03:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't he want to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.85,0:03:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.92,0:04:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What should you do if you have some\Ntrouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.59,0:04:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.13,0:04:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, such as paroxysm amnesia.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.93,0:04:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Paroxysm amnesia?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.03,0:04:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You will forget anything quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.71,0:04:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Or bad direction-sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.94,0:04:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Direction-sense?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.21,0:04:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But the most troublesome is part\Nfailure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.02,0:04:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Part failure?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.25,0:04:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It will break forever if you don't cure\Nhurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.72,0:04:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Impotent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.96,0:04:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, so you must be hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.13,0:04:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,OK, I must ask him to go to factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.90,0:04:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.97,0:04:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Nobita, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.97,0:04:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.71,0:04:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.48,0:04:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit, why didn't he cherish his body,\Nhe is stubborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.95,0:05:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.82,0:05:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.00,0:05:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It is really napoo this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.37,0:05:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.37,0:05:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The secondhand car has been used for\Nten years.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.87,0:05:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It is useless that you repair it,\Nyou should buy another cheap.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.18,0:05:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.18,0:05:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, I am really fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.79,0:05:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And, if I is in hospital for more one\Nyear,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.90,0:05:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,who takes care of Nobita?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.73,0:05:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't know doing anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.70,0:05:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I am tired, let's me sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.29,0:06:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita doesn't know if he can persuade\Nbrother,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.52,0:06:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,if he can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.30,0:06:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Mouse...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.27,0:06:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No, there are mouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.28,0:06:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Mouse...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.78,0:06:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat it...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.82,0:06:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.06,0:06:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What's matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.06,0:06:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you have a nightmare?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.63,0:06:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You cried loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.26,0:06:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Dream, it is vivid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.64,0:07:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Done.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.90,0:07:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But I am lucky that brother thought he\Ndreamed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.42,0:07:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Because your body have something\Nwrong, so you had a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.42,0:07:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You must go to factory hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.49,0:07:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't have a finger in the pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.72,0:07:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I worry you, but you think\NI have a finger in the pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.99,0:07:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You are so stubborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.93,0:07:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, something wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.07,0:07:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.34,0:07:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be worried about.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.24,0:07:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If I am not here, how will you live?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.98,0:07:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I see, you worry me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.28,0:07:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, just because of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.95,0:07:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Even Doraemon isn't here,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.06,0:07:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I am also... fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.93,0:07:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.03,0:08:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.56,0:08:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, if I get full mark tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.63,0:08:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,you go to factory at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.17,0:08:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Full mark?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.50,0:08:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No, 90 mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.24,0:08:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,No, 80 mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.37,0:08:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If I get mark of 70, you go to factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.71,0:08:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If you get mark of 60, I will go to\Nfactory.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.45,0:08:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But you can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.68,0:08:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So, let me try.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.09,0:08:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.54,0:08:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But for Doraemon,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.21,0:08:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I must study hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.12,0:08:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But the mouse was really dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.02,0:09:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.16,0:09:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.37,0:09:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.12,0:09:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Treasure in the pocket...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.45,0:09:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Something is moving in my stomach?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.75,0:09:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be... mouse?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.36,0:09:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But it does not include that mouse\Nran into my mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.86,0:09:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.23,0:09:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it is machine bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.90,0:09:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,But something is really in my stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.77,0:09:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You cheer up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.61,0:09:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.35,0:09:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.58,0:10:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.02,0:10:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.65,0:10:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.69,0:10:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.76,0:10:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Transform small light'
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.03,0:10:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sterilization Light Gun'
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.60,0:10:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon, give me it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.63,0:10:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I transform small with it and enter\Nyour body
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.50,0:10:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And kill bug for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.04,0:10:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No, if you touch high tension line\Nwhat should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.61,0:10:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If you drop into atomic bag, you will\Nbe destroyed and become energy sources.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.45,0:10:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,If you drop into vitta...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.52,0:10:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't delay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.66,0:10:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.13,0:10:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for me, Doraemon,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.77,0:10:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.57,0:10:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.70,0:11:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucky, it is soft, it hasn't been hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.21,0:11:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.51,0:11:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,As if it is rug.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.55,0:11:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It is Rice Cracker.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.95,0:11:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,So here is stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.39,0:11:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon, gees, glut.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.56,0:11:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And didn't bite at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.49,0:11:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You are edacious.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.33,0:11:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be you haven't digested?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.47,0:12:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Something is moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.17,0:12:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it is machine bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.62,0:12:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Mini-Dore
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.99,0:12:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Mini-Dore
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.90,0:12:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon, don't move suddenly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.20,0:12:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Mini-Dore, why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.47,0:12:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Times TV
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.94,0:12:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Dorami.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.24,0:12:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This is detector.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.71,0:12:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It could help you to check failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.05,0:12:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You turn off switch as soon as it\Nenter your stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.05,0:12:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.32,0:12:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Mini-Dore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.02,0:12:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,To enter brother's body, if something\Nwrong...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.89,0:13:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You repair him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.94,0:13:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheer up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.04,0:13:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.05,0:13:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon, what's matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.08,0:13:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Dorami.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.55,0:13:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.89,0:13:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The goods Doraemon swallowed\Ndown isn't mouse, it is Mini-Dore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.96,0:13:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.73,0:13:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,One man can't finish it, Nobita\Nand baby Mini-Dore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.76,0:13:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You entered my body actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.80,0:13:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon is troublesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.01,0:13:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.71,0:13:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,... a detector Dorami gave you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.75,0:13:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It can check failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.65,0:13:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It is near treasure pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.42,0:13:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon, she has know where is\Nwrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.72,0:14:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,She will repair it for you at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.66,0:14:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is a short cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.40,0:14:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It is oil.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.24,0:14:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Its speed is fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.97,0:14:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I tell you that I don't know swimming\Nat all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.84,0:14:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.79,0:14:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,No batteries.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.99,0:14:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What's matter with Nobita?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.99,0:14:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Help.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.23,0:14:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.27,0:14:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I drop in vitta.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.51,0:14:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,So I think it is dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.21,0:14:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Mini-Dore, to take it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.58,0:14:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That, just that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.72,0:15:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Just that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.19,0:15:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,When you meet a person who fell into\Nwater, give him one piece of swim straw.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.13,0:15:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he'll be able to swim.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.17,0:15:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,In spite of going up or down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.01,0:15:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortunately Mini-Dore has a piece of\Nswim straw on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.68,0:15:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, it's too dangerous,\Ncome back right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.68,0:15:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'll cure you by all means.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.92,0:15:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Stained with oil all over,\Nit makes me sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.07,0:15:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.97,0:15:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.37,0:16:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Help, many electric balls are tracing\Nme!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.01,0:16:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the electric balls!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.18,0:16:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll decompose the abnormal\Nmolecules in you body.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.45,0:16:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move, keeping this,\Nit's very hard to run!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.09,0:16:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, hurry to run, hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.23,0:16:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to go home quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.53,0:16:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,At this time you want me to play\Nbaseball!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.88,0:16:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I've played for so long, but no one hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.43,0:16:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I was saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.10,0:16:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.83,0:17:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Found it, just here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.05,0:17:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon,\NI found your failure reason finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.08,0:17:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Why was it frozen?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.42,0:17:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Frozen?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.92,0:17:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't it be that the liquid leaked out?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.02,0:17:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me repair you right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.72,0:17:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't expect you can do it at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.49,0:17:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry to come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.43,0:17:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a bad forefeeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.64,0:17:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That's okay, so simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.07,0:17:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon, I repaired it,\Nyou're all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.81,0:17:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You can still live for a long time...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.65,0:17:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.09,0:17:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost engulfed!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.45,0:17:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost engulfed? What's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.59,0:17:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't it be...the failure part is\Nbeside the bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.36,0:17:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost engulfed?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.69,0:18:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't it be the omnipotent bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.26,0:18:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.97,0:18:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, you mustn't be engulfed!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.84,0:18:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want either!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.91,0:18:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes even I can't find out\Nthe properties in my bag
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.98,0:18:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're engulfed,\Nmaybe I won't find you out for ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.31,0:18:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.45,0:18:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Do your best, Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.99,0:18:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You must do your best.\NI'll do something too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.03,0:18:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I also hope I could!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.60,0:18:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.84,0:18:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.18,0:18:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.02,0:19:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.53,0:19:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita...Nobita
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.87,0:19:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder whether Nobita has persuaded\Nbrother.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.54,0:19:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita! Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.71,0:19:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, he...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.01,0:19:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, what's your problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.18,0:19:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita he...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.82,0:19:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with Nobita?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.75,0:19:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in the bag...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.03,0:19:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita he...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.76,0:19:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.27,0:19:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon, I'm here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.94,0:19:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.85,0:20:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita! Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.99,0:20:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I see, it's been hard on youl!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.12,0:20:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,After all how did you get saved?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.13,0:20:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I would be doomed to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.40,0:20:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Just at the moment that I let go, ...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.01,0:20:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,As a result I got out of it\Nby the umbrella hook.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.61,0:20:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And helped you to bind up your wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.45,0:20:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So it is, great!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.95,0:20:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It causes me to live less for 10 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.96,0:20:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.09,0:20:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a reservation car for repairing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.66,0:20:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You must go to the factory to\Nrepair the failure part.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.37,0:20:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.67,0:20:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,If such thing happens again, it's\Nno use how long your life is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.01,0:21:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So brother, take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.51,0:21:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll wait you over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.15,0:21:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Mini-Dore, Dorami...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.09,0:21:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Good bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.12,0:21:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.66,0:21:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go on studying.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.16,0:21:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I should let you set your heart at rest,\Nthen go to have a physical examination.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.10,0:21:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If only you're willing to do,\Nthere will be no problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.50,0:21:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I got over even the difficulty just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.94,0:21:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.94,0:21:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,My goal is a mark of 60!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.64,0:21:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,How terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.78,0:21:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm very serious!
